<section class="home-faq-section" aria-label="Frequently Asked Questions">
  <div class="homepage-section-container">
    <div class="section-header text-center">
      <span class="hero-tag">Got Questions?</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Quick answers to common questions about our files, licensing, and pricing.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="home-faq-accordion-list">
      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <details class="home-faq-item card glass-panel" open>
        <summary class="home-faq-summary">
          <span class="home-faq-question">Are the files editable?</span>
          <span class="home-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="home-faq-answer">
          <p>
            <strong>Yes, completely.</strong> All vector pattern swatches and graphics come with organized, named, and grouped layers in <strong>AI</strong> (Adobe Illustrator), <strong>EPS</strong>, and <strong>SVG</strong> formats. You can change colors, rescale infinitely with zero pixelation, toggle background layers, and edit stroke weights. Presentation templates include fully editable master slides in <strong>PowerPoint (.PPTX)</strong>, <strong>Apple Keynote (.KEY)</strong>, and <strong>Figma</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <details class="home-faq-item card glass-panel">
        <summary class="home-faq-summary">
          <span class="home-faq-question">Do I need a subscription?</span>
          <span class="home-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="home-faq-answer">
          <p>
            <strong>No subscription required.</strong> Digvolly is 100% pay-as-you-go. You can buy individual packs, or build your own custom 6-asset bundle and get <strong>50% off</strong> the combined total. You only pay for the assets you want, with no monthly bills, recurring charges, or hidden commitments.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <details class="home-faq-item card glass-panel">
        <summary class="home-faq-summary">
          <span class="home-faq-question">Can I use these commercially?</span>
          <span class="home-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="home-faq-answer">
          <p>
            <strong>Yes. Every single asset includes a comprehensive Commercial License.</strong> You are legally authorized to use our assets in client deliverables, commercial packaging, retail merchandise, website design, mobile apps, marketing campaigns, and editorial publications. You are only prohibited from reselling or redistributing the raw source files as standalone digital assets.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>

    <div class="home-faq-footer text-center">
      <a href="/pages/faq" class="button button--secondary home-faq-more-btn">
        View All Download &amp; Format FAQs &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Homepage FAQs",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Homepage FAQs"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
